### 강의 목록
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses

### 강의 단건 (없는 id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/999

### 강의 생성 - 잘못된 enum 값
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "네트워크", "capacity": 30, "dayOfWeek": "MONDAY"}

### 강의 생성 - 정상
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "네트워크", "capacity": 30, "dayOfWeek": "THU"}

### 강의 생성 - 검증 실패
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "", "capacity": 0, "dayOfWeek": "MON"}

### 수강신청 (프론트는 snake_case 로 보냄)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{"student_id": 1, "course_id": 2}

### 없는 학생으로 수강신청
POST http://localhost:8080/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{"student_id": 999, "course_id": 2}

### 학생 1의 신청 내역
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/1/enrollments
